{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Day</b> — as is the way: וכסה את עין הארץ (and it covered the eye of the land). And the sense of כשחר (like dawn) is a single moment." "<b>Nation</b> — joined together, and like it: ארזים לא עממוהו (cedars did not join it) — they did not join with it in a single formation, and thus they called it גוי (nation)." "<b>Has not been</b> — that four kinds should come together."], :book :joel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Joel -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/yoel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:06:27.531773559Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}